1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,419
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:07,719 --> 00:00:15,140
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:23,900
Last time, Qiqi tried on the vain man's big hat.

4
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:31,380
But the mirror only showed herself. Praising yourself is no fun!

5
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:39,100
Today, they arrive at a gray planet with lots of empty bottles!

6
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:43,699
The little prince and Qiqi kept flying, still on their way home.

7
00:00:43,999 --> 00:00:46,699
This time they came to a gray planet.

8
00:00:46,999 --> 00:00:51,299
A man sat on the ground, with many many empty bottles beside him.

9
00:00:51,599 --> 00:00:53,499
He was drinking from a new one.

10
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:56,899
Hello! What are you drinking?

11
00:00:57,199 --> 00:00:59,259
Qiqi asked curiously.

12
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:01,059
I'm drinking wine.

13
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:03,579
The man said with his head down.

14
00:01:03,879 --> 00:01:06,259
Why do you drink wine?

15
00:01:06,559 --> 00:01:08,699
To forget something I'm embarrassed about.

16
00:01:08,999 --> 00:01:12,019
What makes you embarrassed?

17
00:01:12,319 --> 00:01:14,059
Drinking makes me embarrassed.

18
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,779
The man whispered.

19
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:18,779
Qiqi tilted her head and thought.

20
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:24,019
Wait... you drink to forget that you drink?

21
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:27,819
But you're still drinking right now!

22
00:01:28,119 --> 00:01:31,059
The man took another sip and said nothing.

23
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:37,739
He seems to be going in circles and can't get out.

24
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:40,179
Qiqi whispered to the little prince.

25
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:43,259
When you don't look at a problem, it only gets bigger.

26
00:01:43,559 --> 00:01:52,419
Qiqi looked at the empty bottles — more and more and more.

27
00:01:52,719 --> 00:02:01,419
If he stopped and looked at what he's afraid of, would he not need to drink?

28
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:04,819
Yes, facing a problem is braver than running away.

29
00:02:05,119 --> 00:02:10,779
Next time I'm scared, I'll look at it first!

30
00:02:11,079 --> 00:02:15,619
Qiqi held the little prince's hand. They gently flew away.

31
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:19,179
The man's bottles kept growing and growing.

32
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:24,179
Kids, have you ever been scared of something?

33
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:31,179
Try looking at it first — maybe it's not as scary as you think~

34
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:40,979
Next time, Qiqi and the little prince are going to a planet that keeps turning lights on and off!

35
00:02:41,279 --> 00:02:50,779
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

